  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of $A B$ is $y-0=-\\frac{1}{3}(x-3)$\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx+3 y-3=0 \\\\\n|x+3 y-3|^2=10\\left[(x-3)^2+(y-4)^2\\right]\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n(Look at coefficient of $x^2$ and $y^2$ in the\nanswers)",
